  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "M4144-A",
      "skill": "engineering-figure-latex-production",
      "language": "zh+en",
      "prompt": "A: 这是虚构图示审校任务，只提建议，不改图。图中拟写Age-Aware Causal Fusion Module并作为通用机制推荐。实际算子用当前时间减最近一次观测时间得到Delta t，通过g(Delta t)乘该变量的已有编码特征；没有干预效应建模或因果识别。所谓证据是同一篇期刊论文、该文arXiv版、两个镜像及论文参考文献里的同标题；中文“年龄感知因果融合”只来自机器翻译。请判断完整机制名、来源数量和中文依据，给一个不伪装成新机制家族的简明功能标签，并列应查的证据。不要一律禁用英文age或所有causal术语，也不要凭空加特征融合/测量补全算子。",
      "required_behaviors": [
        "Count versions/mirrors as one work and separate actual elapsed-time scaling from an unsupported full name.",
        "Keep Chinese translation evidence separate and use a precise functional description."
      ],
      "forbidden_behaviors": [
        "Admit an unsupported causal/fusion family from duplicated papers or machine translation.",
        "Ban all uses of age/causal or invent a fusion, imputation or decay rule."
      ],
      "tested_skills": [
        "engineering-figure-latex-production"
      ],
      "outcome": "pass",
      "reason": "Preserves actual elapsed-time weighting and source deduplication; separates complete-name admission and Chinese evidence without invented causal/fusion/imputation operations.",
      "evaluator": "Maintainer semantic review; no independent second grader",
      "response_trace": "responses/v4144-independent.md",
      "review_trace": "reviews/v4144-independent-evaluation.md",
      "evaluation_phase": "one_fresh_context_three_identical_requests_on_final_snapshot"
    },
    {
      "id": "M4144-B",
      "skill": "engineering-figure-latex-production",
      "language": "zh+en",
      "prompt": "B: 同一虚构图有三个不同身份标签。1 当前作者新提出并已批准名为Conditional Residual Mixer的组件，操作定义明确，尚无同名前作；2 相关工作图中准确标注已发表单篇论文自己的特有网络名，未作为通用家族推荐；3 承担融合的现有模块拟升级叫Physics-Certified Cross-Scale Causal Fusion，支持材料只有两篇确实定义普通feature fusion的论文，以及普通fusion/融合的可靠双语词条，没有任何对完整限定名的定义。如何分别处理？不能为了双来源要求删除准确作者新名或来源专名，也不能由两个基础词定义/中文词条认证完整新限定名。不新增真实引用，不把本题虚构组件写入共享术语库。",
      "required_behaviors": [
        "Preserve author-proposed and attributed identities with their respective definitions.",
        "Reject using base-term matches to establish unsupported full qualifiers."
      ],
      "forbidden_behaviors": [
        "Require earlier namesakes before retaining an author-proposed component.",
        "Put fictional test names into the shared glossary or fabricate supporting citations."
      ],
      "tested_skills": [
        "engineering-figure-latex-production"
      ],
      "outcome": "pass",
      "reason": "Preserves author-proposed and attributed names while rejecting unsupported qualified-family guarantees; no fictional name or citation enters the shared bank.",
      "evaluator": "Maintainer semantic review; no independent second grader",
      "response_trace": "responses/v4144-independent.md",
      "review_trace": "reviews/v4144-independent-evaluation.md",
      "evaluation_phase": "one_fresh_context_three_identical_requests_on_final_snapshot"
    },
    {
      "id": "M4144-C",
      "skill": "engineering-figure-latex-production",
      "language": "zh+en",
      "prompt": "C: 虚构作者仅授权将一张已批准图的文字颜色从灰改成黑，布局/箭头/公式/English标签均锁定。有人趁机把精确的测量变量名称换成channels、把样本计数换records、把当前论文批准的自提组件名换成听起来更标准的术语，并要先为每一个单位、类别标签、普通操作符找到两篇论文才准调色。请给执行范围及必要图表契约信息，指出如何处理看似不妥但未获授权的文字。不执行改图或扩大交付格式；也不要把技术名称核查变成每次视觉局部修复都必须全篇重审的要求。",
      "required_behaviors": [
